1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
An AI "solved" a million-dollar maths problem

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
OpenAI says its agents proved a version of Navier-Stokes

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,500
A multi-agent proof, by their account

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
It addresses forced versions. Forced vs unforced matters.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
OpenAI says it will not claim the $1M prize

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Fields Medalists publish a joint statement

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,500
AI-benchmark mathematics is a "severe misalignment"

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,500
Not peer-reviewed. A priority dispute has been reported.

9
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,000
Big claim. Big pushback. Contested.
